  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT/MP_MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT_Header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2380\" height=\"874\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>多重箭矢效果</strong> 新增了一種合成機制，讓你能將最多三種藥水效果融合至單一支箭矢中，整合所有屬性以創造出極具多樣性與策略性的投射物。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT/MP_MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT_Description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"236\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">這個模組允許你結合藥水箭矢，並將其屬性融合為單次射擊。你可以在同一支箭矢上疊加最多 3 種不同的藥水效果，創造出能同時施加多重效果的強大投射物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1396590/description_b5ceb87e-ed2f-456a-9c49-4403ed3be7dc.png\" width=\"368\" height=\"285\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">所有設定皆可完全自訂：你可以調整最大結合效果數量、微調持續時間、封鎖特定藥水，或直接透過設定檔案更改合成行為，讓系統能完美適應任何世界或模組包。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">本模組與其他箭矢及藥水模組完全相容，可套用遊戲中任何藥水的效果。藥水箭矢的製作方式是將箭矢圍繞滯留藥水擺放，讓你能附加任何效果，並在後續將其融合為一支強化投射物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_eb7f55c5-3947-420b-89ff-328b3a283b3e.png\"></span></p>\n</div><div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>想和朋友一起遊玩嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT/MP_MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT_Promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"353\"></strong></a></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>立即取得專屬的 Minecraft 伺服器</strong></a></span><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">，與朋友共創無盡冒險！憑藉頂尖效能與可靠運作時間，我們的伺服器保證為所有人帶來流暢有趣的遊戲體驗。使用優惠碼 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>THEWIZARD</strong> </a>即可享有 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">25% 折扣！</span></strong></a></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FqhuAjYTGv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT/MP_MULTI_ARROW_EFFECT_Discord.webp\" width=\"2382\" height=\"235\"></span></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
